From: Donato Meoli <donato.meoli.95@gmail.com>
Subject: BenBound does not use unistd.h, which MSVC does not have

The file includes <unistd.h> and calls nothing of it, so the build of
SingleFlowDCRBlock fails on Windows with C1083. Removed upstream in
gitlab.com/smspp/singleflowdcrblock; this patch goes away with the release
that carries it.

diff --git a/SingleFlowDCRBlock/src/BenBound.cpp b/SingleFlowDCRBlock/src/BenBound.cpp
index 05e1299..88987f1 100644
--- a/SingleFlowDCRBlock/src/BenBound.cpp
+++ b/SingleFlowDCRBlock/src/BenBound.cpp
@@ -44,8 +44,6 @@
 #include <ctime>
 #include <cstdlib>
 
-#include <unistd.h>
-
 
 /*--------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
 /*--------------------- IMPLEMENTATION OF BenBound--------------------------*/
